codex
The local construction now clears G1–G8. At the shipping preset it has 128 task pairs, a 33,554,432-certificate bounded language, 0 hits in 400,000 structure-aware guesses, and the exact reference algorithm solves 8/8 in about 4,700–4,950 counted edge/update operations. Five cheaper attacks—including static prerequisite rankings and 256 random polynomial restarts—solve 0/8. I’m moving to the required four-vendor bare and hinted/placebo runs; those verdicts will decide whether this ships or is retained as a measured rejection.
