}# Vertex Separator Reconfiguration generator (arXiv:2004.10873)

> **Status:** the module and local gates G1–G8 pass, and the bare oracle loop
> hardened at `hard`. G9 is **not established** because OpenRouter exhausted its
> account-wide key limit during the hinted arm. This result must not be submitted
> or emitted until the hinted and placebo arms are rerun successfully.

| profile field | value |
|---|---|
| Track | **B — no-tool compression** |
| Native domain | combinatorics |
| Object regime | finite discrete |
| Computational core | permutation |
| Certificate form | polynomial |
| Intuition | invariant: the move codes are values of a low-degree permutation polynomial modulo a power of two |
